  "stem": "In right triangle \\(PQR\\), angle \\(Q\\) is a right angle, \\(PQ = 6\\), and \\(QR = 8\\). What is the value of \\(\\tan R\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "3/4",
    "0.75"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "For angle \\(R\\), the opposite leg is \\(PQ = 6\\) and the adjacent leg is \\(QR = 8\\).",
    "\\(\\tan R = \\frac{6}{8} = \\frac{3}{4}\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
